          "name": "What math is on the ATI TEAS?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "ATI TEAS Math includes Numbers and Algebra plus Measurement and Data. Practice should cover fractions, decimals, percentages, ratios, proportions, equations, word problems, unit conversions, geometry basics, graphs, charts, tables, and data interpretation."
